*.db3
*.mcap
log.txt

# ---- 预编译大二进制：超出 GitHub 100MB 上限，需从厂商 SDK 包另行获取 ----
# MANUS SDK 动态库（每个 112~137MB）
**/ManusSDK/lib/*.so
# PICO SDK 调试符号与平台插件
*.pdb
**/Plugins/Windows/VolcEngineRTC.dll
# 编译产物
*.o
*.a
*.so.dbg
*.sym.so
*.dbg.so
*.aar

# ---- 嵌套仓库自身的 git 元数据（源码本身照常提交）----
airbot+hand-workspace/revo2_description/.git/

